            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "ENROLLMENT ( ) I hereby request that I be enrolled as an active member of the Sick Leave Bank. I understand that I must initially contribute one day of sick leave and may be asked to make future contributions at such time(s) as the Bank's available sick leave reaches 300 days. I further understand that membership is voluntary and that donated days will not be returned except as provided for in the Sick Leave Bank program.",
